{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<img alt=\"銅鑼灣電器舖一批相機和鏡頭疑被職員偷去　總值188萬元\" src=\"https://news.now.com/nownews/NewsImage/WC-THEFT-261119-23.jpg\"><p>【Now新聞台】銅鑼灣一間電器舖有相機和鏡頭疑被職員偷去。</p><p>銅鑼灣時代廣場一間店舖，有61部相機及55個鏡頭不翼而飛，總值約188萬元。警方將案件列作盜竊跟進，追緝約40歲男子。據了解是店舖職員。</p></body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-19T15:59:45.903106+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":98,"images":1,"source":"Now 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-19T15:19:33+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-20T00:17:35.915927+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-19T15:53:16.921508+00:00","content_hash":"e41222fe7da57ced95dc039a50f4cf7aca860a377091a8569322dc0477bb3acd","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}